      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Keane Thompson proudly presents 24 Kilcross Court, a superb three-bedroom family home ideally positioned in a quiet cul de sac within this mature and highly sought-after estate in Sandyford Village. This well-maintained property offers bright, versatile living accommodation and is presented in very good condition throughout.\r\n\r\nFrom the moment you arrive, the peaceful setting is immediately apparent. Tucked away in a tranquil cul de sac, this home provides privacy and safety, making it ideal for families and those seeking a quieter lifestyle while remaining close to every amenity. The ground floor accommodation is both practical and flexible. A welcoming entrance hallway leads to the main living areas. Upstairs, there are three well-proportioned bedrooms and a spacious main family bathroom. A key feature of this home is the large West facing garden which is not overlooked. This wonderful outdoor space enjoys sunshine throughout the afternoon and evening, making it perfect for entertaining, gardening, or simply relaxing in privacy. The garden is not overlooked and offers excellent potential for further landscaping or future expansion (subject to planning permission). \r\nViewing of this home is highly recommended. \r\n\r\nKilcross is a mature residential estate adjacent to Sandyford Village, offering a convenient and well-connected lifestyle. Residents benefit from excellent transport links, including the Luas Green Line, approximately a 25-minute walk to Glencairn and Kilmacud, and a bus services just a few minutes away, with easy access to the M50 motorway. The area is well-served with a wide range of amenities, from restaurants, bars, to gyms, beauty salons, golf clubs, public parks, and sports clubs. Families will find excellent schools nearby, while retail options abound at Dundrum Town Centre, Carrickmines Shopping Centre, Foxrock, and Stillorgan Villages. A new playground at the front of the estate adds to the family-friendly appeal. For those who love walking there is a scenic walkway through the back of the estate provides access to Ticknock Hill, ideal for walking and cycling. This property represents a rare opportunity to acquire a move-in-ready home in a prime location, perfectly balancing comfort, convenience, and lifestyle.\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nAccommodation c. 83 sqm.\r\nPlease refer to floor plans for room dimensions\r\n\r\nFront Entry\r\nBright entrance with understairs storage space.\r\n\r\nLiving/dining room\r\nSemi-solid wood flooring, gas fireplace, coving. \r\n\r\nKitchen \r\nTiled floor, tiled splashback, plumbed for dishwasher & washing machine.\r\n\r\nGarden 19mL x 8mW\r\nSout west facing, laid in lawn and patio, not overlooked with attached storage shed. \r\n\r\nUpstairs\r\n\r\nBathroom\r\nFully tiled, electric power shower, wash hand basin and WC.\r\n\r\nLanding\r\nCarpet flooring, hot press/storage. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1\r\nTo front, laminate flooring, built in wardrobe.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2\r\nTo rear, laminate flooring, built in wardrobe.  \r\n\r\nBedroom 3\r\nTo front, semi solid wood flooring, built in wardrobe."
      },
